---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About | Fabio Capela">
	<div class="max-w-3xl">
		<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-8 text-gray-900">
			The observer <br/>
            is the observed.
		</h1>
		
		<p class="text-xl leading-relaxed mb-8 text-gray-700">
			I am Fabio Capela, a researcher interested in mathematics and theoretical physics in general, 
            with a focus on the intersection of differential geometry, information theory, and large language models.
		</p>

        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            My work focuses on interpreting neural networks not as black-box function approximators, 
            but as geometric objects whose training dynamics can be analyzed using the tools of modern physics.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-12 mb-6 border-b border-gray-200 pb-2 text-gray-900">Scientific Background</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
            With a PhD in Theoretical Physics, I've spent over a decade applying mathematical rigor to 
            complex systems. You can find my previous research contributions on 
            <a href="https://arxiv.org/search/?searchtype=author&query=Capela%2C+F" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">arXiv</a>.
        </p>

        <div class="bg-gray-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 mt-12">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 mb-4 m-0">Contact</h3>
            <p class="font-mono text-sm mb-0 text-gray-800">
                research [at] labfab.io
            </p>
        </div>
	</div>
</Layout>
